```

In the fragment above, the total value locked (`tvl`) is calculated over all vaults licensed with `KerosineManager`. As can be seen [from the deployment script](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-dyad/blob/cd48c684a58158de444b24854ffd8f07d046c31b/script/deploy/Deploy.V2.s.sol#L64-L65) those are the freshly created `ethVault` and `wstEth`, which balances wrt. the corresponding assets are initially zero, while the total supply of DYAD is non-zero. As a result, any attempt to calculate `assetPrice()` for the `UnboundedKerosineVault` will underflow and revert.

