## Impact

An attacker can set `keroseneManager` to an arbitrary `KerosineManager` contract and deliberately choose to not license any vaults. This would result in a DoS for any functionality within the vault manager that relies on Kerosene vaults being licensed. Kerosene would be unusable throughout the vault manager.

