## Description

The `deposit` function allows any user to deposit into any vault, as long as the ID is valid and the "vault" address has a `deposit` or fallback function. There is no check to confirm if the vault is licensed or added by the ID. If funds are sent to an address that isn't a true vault, the function doesn't revert. However, it does update `idToBlockOfLastDeposit`, which could potentially enable a Denial of Service (DoS) attack on the `withdraw` function by any user willing to pay the gas fees. This could potentially lead to a ransom situation.

