# Vulnerability details

The liquidation game is between two `dNft` holders this makes the game internal, if the collateral ratio of one the `dNft` drops another `dNft` is incentiviced to liquidate them to earn liquiditation fees of more than 20% depending on how deep the undercollateralization goes.

However when both parties are  undercollateralized they can liquidate each other. This doesn't just deny users with healthy collateral ratios the rewards it can also cause cases where the collateral ratio of `to` doesn't increase enough back to the  healthy ratio making the vault have bad collaterals.

