# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Incorrectly calculating the collateral ratio will cause the project to lose funds. In the `VaultManagerV2.sol` the collateral ratio is figured out in the `collatRatio` function based on the total USD value of all vaults. This calculation currently lets users borrow more than 150% of what they have as collateral.

